    "ACHIEVEMENT_HABIBI_CHRONO_MASTERYACHIEVEMENT_NAME": "超时空军团兵：精通",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_HABIBI_CHRONO_MASTERYACHIEVEMENT_DESCRIPTION": "作为超时空军团兵，在Monsoon难度下通关游戏或抹除自己。",
