    "HABIBI_CHRONO_SPECIAL_VANISH_DRIVER_NAME": "解构",
    "HABIBI_CHRONO_SPECIAL_VANISH_DRIVER_DESCRIPTION": "集中步枪火力，最多造成<style=cIsDamage>360%伤害</style>。低于<style=cIsUtility>超时空病</style>阈值的敌人会从存在中消失。",
    "HABIBI_CHRONO_ITEM_SICKNESS_NAME": "超时空病",
    "HABIBI_CHRONO_ITEM_SICKNESS_DESCRIPTION": "敌人在超时空球内会累积超时空病。"
